        "answer_relevancy": 0.9436793155425924,
        "context_precision": 0.9999999999,
        "context_recall": 1.0
      },
      "answer": "Personal\u2011Care substitutions are governed by the following restrictions (all drawn from the Substitutions Policy):\n- **Brand\u2011only substitution:** Personal\u2011Care items may be substituted **only** across pack sizes of the **identical product**, never across different brands[1].\n- **Same\u2011product, same\u2011brand rule:** An acceptable substitute must be the same product and same brand, differing only in pack size, **or** the same product from a different brand **within the same category**[3].\n- **Price ceiling:** The substitute\u2019s price must be within\u202f15\u202f% of the original line price; any excess is absorbed by Nimbus Now and the customer is never charged more[3].\n- **Dietary\u2011attribute match:** A vegetarian Personal\u2011Care item can never be swapped for a non\u2011vegetarian one under any circumstance[3].\n- **Storage\u2011class match:** A chilled Personal\u2011Care item cannot be replaced with an ambient\u2011class item[3].\n- **Customer consent:** A substitution is never applied silently; the customer receives a notification and has **90\u202fseconds** to accept or reject it before the line is refunded[2].",
      "error": null
    },
